    "author": "Neptune Technical Editorial",
    "originalUrl": "https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/news/security-access-management-one-of-the-most-important-today/",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Security is the main thing that the organizations mainly look for today. There are various types of <strong><em>security systems</em></strong> are available that provides complete safety. The access management is also an issue in big organizations. Several automatic security and access management system has been implemented by big companies, the corporate world, and in hotel industries and shopping malls which are highly advanced. Let me give some examples to make it clear what I am actually talking about.</p>\n<h1><strong>Some Highly Automated Security and Access Management System</strong></h1>\n<h2><strong>Automated Gates and Doors</strong></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-499 alignleft\" src=\"/assets/images/blogs/sliding-gate-300x147.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"103\" srcset=\"/assets/images/blogs/sliding-gate-300x147.jpg 300w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/sliding-gate-768x377.jpg 768w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/sliding-gate-280x137.jpg 280w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/sliding-gate.jpg 877w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 211px) 100vw, 211px\" /></p>\n<p>There are various types of <strong><em>automated gates</em></strong> and <strong><em>sliding</em></strong> or <strong><em>swinging</em></strong> <strong><em>doors</em></strong> available that needs no human engagement while operating the gates or doors. They are highly advanced in nature and provide complete security at the entrance. They prohibit trespassing activities and also disallow vehicles that are unauthorized.</p>\n\n<h2><strong>Boom Barriers</strong></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-868 alignleft\" src=\"/assets/images/blogs/faac-b680h-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"Faac-B680H\" width=\"207\" height=\"207\" srcset=\"/assets/images/blogs/faac-b680h-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Faac-B680H-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Faac-B680H-187x187.jpg 187w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Faac-B680H.jpg 350w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 207px) 100vw, 207px\" /></p>\n<p>These are the <strong><em>automatic barriers</em></strong> that check the authority of the vehicle that wants to cross the line. It automatically checks the authority without the interference of any human. They will open the line of control for a certain time frame and within that small amount of time; the vehicle needs to pass the authorization to make an entry.</p>\n\n<h2><strong>Parking Management Systems</strong></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-1371 alignleft\" src=\"/assets/images/blogs/parking-guidance-system-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"208\" height=\"139\" srcset=\"/assets/images/blogs/parking-guidance-system-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Parking-Guidance-System-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Parking-Guidance-System-280x187.jpg 280w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/Parking-Guidance-System.jpg 940w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 208px) 100vw, 208px\" /></p>\n<p>It is such an incredible system that offers the visitors smooth and easy parking of their vehicles. The system is very advanced with highly automated space management software that shows the way to the visitors how to park their vehicles after maintaining a safe distance from the other vehicles that are parked in the vicinity. There are multiple automated checkpoints to collect the toll from the visitors. They also monitor the number of vehicles parked in the compound along with time to time analytics with accurate data.</p>\n<h2><strong>High-Security Bollards</strong></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-909 alignleft\" src=\"/assets/images/blogs/faac-j275-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"FAAC J275\" width=\"207\" height=\"207\" srcset=\"/assets/images/blogs/faac-j275-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/faac-J275-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/faac-J275-187x187.jpg 187w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/faac-J275.jpg 350w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 207px) 100vw, 207px\" /></p>\n<p>The finest product when it comes to security. They are in cylindrical shapes and solely responsible for checking the entry of unauthorized vehicles, by stopping them from trespassing</p>\n<p>Sometimes they are used along with the <a href=\"https://neptuneautomatic.com/products/automatic-boom-barrier/\">boom barriers</a> to check the authorization part. There is a sensor fixed in it that keeps track of all the activities that are happening around. They also capture the surrounding movements with the cameras installed within these machines. So, they provide overall security at the <strong><em>parking place</em></strong>.</p>\n<h2><strong>Pedestrian Access Gates</strong></h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-965 alignleft\" src=\"/assets/images/blogs/sesame_new-271x300.jpg\" alt=\"Sesame\" width=\"208\" height=\"230\" srcset=\"/assets/images/blogs/sesame_new-271x300.jpg 271w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/sesame_NEW-169x187.jpg 169w, https://www.neptuneautomatic.com/wp-content/uploads/sesame_NEW.jpg 341w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 208px) 100vw, 208px\" /></p>\n<p>These are the access gates that control the pedestrian movements. There are several types of these gates are available that can be fixed indoor or outdoor depending upon the requirements.</p>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://neptuneautomatic.com/products/pedestrian-gates/\">tripod turnstile</a> access gates control the human movements and in case of an emergency, they unlock the inclined bars which start revolving both ways allowing the pedestrian movements without any restrictions. The bars are fixed at an inclination of 120 degrees to each other and there are three bars in total.</p>\n\n<p>The access gates with the normal square bar are specially designed for people with physical disabilities.</p>\n<p>There are nicely designed access gates available that can be installed at the <strong><em>corporate office</em></strong><em> <strong>lobbies</strong></em>, <strong><em>theatres</em></strong><em>, <strong>railway</strong> <strong>stations</strong>, <strong>stadiums</strong></em> or anywhere there is an allowance for a single person entry.</p>\n<h1><strong> </strong></h1>"
