    "rawDate": "2026-04-18",
    "readTime": "3 min read",
    "image": "/assets/images/slide4-parking-management.webp",
    "excerpt": "With the increase in vehicles, roads are rarely seen free. Indian commuters faces a lot of problems because of Traffic expansion. Even when the question comes to park any vehicle, the roads are still congested. Parking makes people not only frustrated but also sometimes become the reason for conflict arising. People are tired of searching",
    "author": "Neptune Technical Editorial",
