    "contentHtml": "<p>With the increase in vehicles, roads are rarely seen free. Indian commuters faces a lot of problems because of Traffic expansion. Even when the question comes to park any vehicle, the roads are still congested. Parking makes people not only frustrated but also sometimes become the reason for conflict arising. People are tired of searching a solution for parking &amp; dealing with the daily traffic. It makes them irritated &amp; annoying affecting their regular routine.</p>\n<p>To pull up this issue, government bodies &amp; other business corporations is bounded to take strict action against this problem &amp; improve space for the bearers. Many measures had been taken by the government to eradicate the problem which is not possible but can be uprooted to an extent.</p>\n<p>One of the solutions that can help people to pull up the problem of parking is <a href=\"https://neptuneautomatic.com/parking-guidance/smart-parking-solution/\">Smart Parking Solution</a>. The system can help bearers to find vacant parking spots quickly. Some basic Smart parking services includes parking management &amp; transportation services. The system also handles the traffic monitoring by making the traveler aware about ongoing traffic &amp; the left over space to park their vehicle remotely.</p>\n<p>There are some necessary guidelines to make the system run smoothly without any further difficulties.</p>\n<p>This Parking management system consist of following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Information where the traveler is moving.</li>\n<li>Vehicle counting revealing the number of vehicle obstacle in your parking.</li>\n<li>Parking guidance showing the right way to park the vehicle.</li>\n<li>Video observation making it more reachable.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This solution is deployed all over India such as shopping malls,railway stations, airports, hospitals &amp; other big main organizations. All these are benefiting from this wonderful system but there are still some deprived organizations. The pre-booking of the space can also be done with this system. This can be done online with online payment gateway. There are various payment options for this system. Some of the organizations allows users to pay via Internet or Telephone &amp; other software’s.</p>\n<p>The system guides visitors to the parking lot via maps and navigation. With the use of these navigation s, visitors are informed about a parking space whether it is occupied, reserved or vacant. This allows users to get informed about parking decision.</p>\n<p>Along with all these features, this brilliant system will help one to reach the suitable parking location. Apart from this, other advantages of this system are:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fast retrieval of the occupancy.</li>\n<li>Relocation problem gets solved.</li>\n<li>If any other parking is available, it adds an additional parking if required.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This feature easy, user friendly, hassle- free &amp; conflict- free system made parking availability issue can be resolved by just one system. The limited roads, parking areas &amp; even the open fields are already packed. One can save their precious time &amp; money after choosing this automated system.</p>"
