    "excerpt": "Modernization is forcing people to adapt latest technologies not only in their daily routine but also in social life. The use of these technologies made their life easy & comfortable. People are even so fed up of battling with old versioned things. Modern transitions are equally important nowadays to maintain their status also. They even",
